<title>USA: AAR signs parts agreement with GE unit.</title>
<headline>AAR signs parts agreement with GE unit.</headline>
<dateline>WOOD DALE, Ill. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAR Corp said Wednesday it signed a memorandum of understanding to obtain exclusive rights to supply jet engine parts to a unit of General Electric Co.</p>
<p>AAR, which supplies aviation and aerospace products and services, said it will provide a customized parts and inventory management program to GE Engine Services in Brazil.</p>
<p>A definitive agreement is expected by the end of April, the companies said. Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>AAR shares closed up 1/4 Wednesday at 29-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
